.\" kushare-gui manual page (English; installed as the default page). The
.\" Spanish one is ../es/kushare-gui.1.
.TH KUSHARE\-GUI 1 "2026-11-25" "kushare" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kushare\-gui \- kushare window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kushare\-gui
.br
.B kushare\-gui \-\-reply
.I "TITLE TEXT"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kushare\-gui
is the window of
.BR kushare (1),
in the style of Phone Link. It is what the
.B kushare
launcher in the applications menu opens. Pages:
.TP 16
.B Home
Link status and shortcuts.
.TP
.B Phone
Battery, ringer, call, media players and audio outputs.
.TP
.B Messages
SMS conversations; read and reply.
.TP
.B Calls
Recent calls and a dial pad (with DTMF tones during a call).
.TP
.B Photos
The phone's gallery: view, download and delete.
.TP
.B Notifications
Those currently on the phone: dismiss, actions and replies.
.TP
.B Clipboard
Shared history.
.TP
.B Camera & mic
The phone as a webcam or microphone, and the QR scanner.
.TP
.B Devices
Pair, unpair and per-app notification filters.
.TP
.B Send
Send files over Wi-Fi or Bluetooth.
.TP
.B Settings
Theme (System, Light, Dark, OLED), animations, menu position, phone panel,
language, daemon settings, updates and
.BR "Share internet" :
a Wi-Fi network from the PC for the phone, with name, password (or a random
one), QR code and a button to send it to the phone.
.PP
The window adapts to its width: when there is room it shows the phone panel at
the side and, during a call, a bar to control it from any page.
.PP
It is a D-Bus client of the daemon; if the daemon is not running it says so and
connects when it starts. Closing the window does not stop the daemon (use
.B "kushare quit"
for that).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-reply " TITLE TEXT"
Open only a small window to reply to a phone notification. The daemon uses it
when
.B Reply
is clicked on a notification; there is no need to run it by hand.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/kushare/gui.toml
Window preferences: theme, animations, menu position
.RB ( nav )
and phone panel
.RB ( side_panel ).
.TP
.I ~/.config/kushare/language
Language chosen in Settings.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KUSHARE_GUI_SCREEN
Initial page:
.BR phone ", " messages ", " calls ", " photos ", " notifications ,
.BR clipboard ", " camera ", " devices " or " settings .
.TP
.B KUSHARE_LANG
Language
.RB ( es ", " en ).
See
.BR kushare (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kushare (1),
.BR kushare\-tui (1).
